Why this folder is licensed differently from the rest of qbPortWeaver

This plugin imports Nicotine+ internals and is loaded into the Nicotine+ process,
which makes it a derivative work of Nicotine+ (GPL-3.0-or-later). It is therefore
licensed GPL-3.0-or-later, and that licence applies to everything in this folder.

The rest of qbPortWeaver is not affected. qbPortWeaver is a separate program in a
separate process that talks to this plugin over a documented HTTP/JSON protocol -
the same arm's-length relationship it has with qBittorrent's Web API - so no GPL
obligation extends to it.

The full text of the GNU General Public License version 3 is available at
<https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt>, and is also distributed with
Nicotine+ itself.
